{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts","id":1526935,"title":"How do you get out the habit of not turning pc's into self inserts?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-12-16T12:02:50-08:00","id":1526935,"title":"How do you get out the habit of not turning pc's into self inserts?","content":"It's something that I sometimes find myself struggling with and try not to do that as the whole point of our hobby is playing characters that are not you at all. I try to remind myself that I'm doing something enjoyable and taking a break from the real world. Still it's hard not to fall into and I wonder do any of you fellow gamers have the same issue?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T19:58:00-08:00","id":1526960,"title":"","content":"Half of our D&amp;D player-group were in the drama-club in high-school and they loved to act, so, early on, we all caught onto playing characters and not being ourselves. <br /> <br /> I did run a mortals game for V:tM /WoD, were we played ourselves, but the goal was to get supernatural-powers, and be happy with a potence 1. Some players loved it; others hated it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-16T20:19:03-08:00","id":1526961,"title":"","content":"I think every PC you create has (or at least should have) some aspects of yourself in them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-17T10:44:43-08:00","id":1526985,"title":"","content":"That is true that you want to put some elements of yourself, but I would try to add elements of other people I know or characters from my favourite authors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-17T12:54:13-08:00","id":1526995,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m not sure I understand the problem. I\u2019ve played both a direct self-insert character as well as several who were nothing like me, and I enjoyed both. I agree with Amethyst that it\u2019s not actually possible to completely eliminate all traces of your own personality from whatever character you portray, but I\u2019m not sure that\u2019s what you are asking.<br /> <br /> Usually whenever I want to play something that isn\u2019t a self-insert it\u2019ll be a creature of a completely different species, something not even close to human. To me the standard D&amp;D races of elf, dwarf, halfling, and gnome are too human-adjacent as opposed to things like lizardfolk, catfolk, thri-kreen or various planetouched.<br /> <br /> I think I would have trouble adding personality elements from the characters of authors I know since I don\u2019t have the same window into that character\u2019s thought process as the author does.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-18T04:35:51-08:00","id":1527045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts?p=1526985#post1526985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is true that you want to put some elements of yourself, but I would try to add elements of other people I know or characters from my favourite authors.</div> </div> </div> </div>Adding elements from people you know is a good idea. That\u2019s what published writers do when they create characters for their books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-18T13:02:17-08:00","id":1527062,"title":"","content":"@Darksolaernium self inserts have gotten something of bad rap as some people have used it as means to beat you over the head by preaching to yon on how bad you are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-22T09:33:53-08:00","id":1527246,"title":"","content":"Ngl, I also have a problem of making PC's into self-inserts or ripoffs of other characters I like, especially Sephiroth, Leon S. Kennedy, Tamaki Suoh, and Motoko Kusanagi","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-26T09:03:50-08:00","id":1527461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts?p=1527246#post1527246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ngl, I also have a problem of making PC's into self-inserts or ripoffs of other characters I like, especially Sephiroth, Leon S. Kennedy, Tamaki Suoh, and Motoko Kusanagi</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, that's a really good way to avoid making only self-inserts. Find a fictional or historical character you know really well and always try to do what you think they would do. That way, even if some of yourself creeps in, it's now all mixed-up in the other character and you have a unique mashup","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-28T12:00:34-08:00","id":1527563,"title":"","content":"That is good advice Matt &amp; Master Aquatosic and it would help to better mesh my characters that are inspired by others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T14:10:15-08:00","id":1528340,"title":"","content":"I'm usually the ST for 2e Exalted games*. When I get to be a player I do what I do for an NPC ... roll some dice to see what the character is going to be good at and unskilled at.<br /> <br /> My last PC: a Wood Aspect who favored Linguistics, Resistance, and Dodge.<br /> <br /> I am not multi-lingual, spent 55 days of 2023 hospitalized, and won't even attempt to walk without wearing boots.<br /> <br /> I could work with that. That PC was good at a whole lot of things I'm not good at.<br /> <br /> The PC was very good with a bow at long range. I'm better than average with a rifle at 400yds in that I can expect to hit a stationary target at that range. That's about the only bit of common I had with the PC. The PC was rolling 14+ dice before stunts and charms with a Jade Long Powerbow while, if I was a PC I'd get, at most, 10 dice with a scoped rifle ... at that range.<br /> <br /> * I have hardcopies and .pdf's of all the 2e Books. 5 of my players are teenagers who aren't going blow their allowance on an rpg rulebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28256-eumelia","name":"Eumelia","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T11:31:40-07:00","id":1536893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts?p=1526961#post1526961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think every PC you create has (or at least should have) some aspects of yourself in them.</div> </div> </div> </div>True when it comes to what I would do in a combat situation. I would strike hard and fast then run like hell and made my Malkavian character the same way and more importantly try not to put himself in situations that he didn't have a couple of escape routes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-07T14:00:23-07:00","id":1536901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts?p=1526961#post1526961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think every PC you create has (or at least should have) some aspects of yourself in them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the Like \ud83d\ude0a","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u2615","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-08T20:17:55-07:00","id":1537055,"title":"","content":"It's difficult not to have aspects of yourself in your PC; most people play WoD, as if they are themselves, but supernatural. I tried to be different,but it's tough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-12T11:04:47-07:00","id":1537269,"title":"","content":"I know and I don't want to play myself as I tend to be quite implusive in real life and I find it hard to play the opposite of that in a game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-13T02:51:28-07:00","id":1537295,"title":"","content":"I've never had the option to play myself for very long (as the perma-DM my presence is usually a background character at best), but in the brief examples I have to work with I seem to be both meticulous and cautious, given to elaborate behind the scenes scheming. I always end up thinking I've put a lot of stress on whoever is the DM of that brief (for it is always brief) game since I'll ask all sorts of obscure setting and lore questions looking for some off-path to my personal success.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u2615","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-04-05T00:29:43-07:00","id":1559227,"title":"","content":"Go the Vegapunk route and split your personality into multiple characters.<br /> <br /> They'll still be self inserts, but it will be less obvious!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-04-06T11:43:48-07:00","id":1559252,"title":"","content":"That could work Dark King, but I find it to self indulgent and I like basing the other characters on other people I have met or know reasonably well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-04-19T09:32:55-07:00","id":1559525,"title":"","content":"I don't worry about that nor do I get on my player's case about that either.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2783-tytalus","name":"Tytalus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2783_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"491"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-02T23:13:45-07:00","id":1559711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts?p=1559252#post1559252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That could work Dark King, but I find it to self indulgent and I like basing the other characters on other people I have met or know reasonably well.</div> </div> </div> </div>When I first got into role playing, I would just straight up insert myself as the character. Even giving it my real name and personality.<br /> <br /> Took years for me to finally grow out of that habit. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-14T07:47:58-07:00","id":1561684,"title":"","content":"You should answer a few questions first:<br /> <br /> 1. Has it been a problem in your games?<br /> <br /> 2. If it has been a problem, why? What exactly is going wrong?<br /> <br /> 3. What about yourself do you put in the characters so frequently?<br /> <br /> 4. Can you say why you do this? How you feel when doing it?<br /> <br /> 5. Do you do it consciously or without notice?<br /> <br /> 6. The self-insert has the same life as you? How does it differ?<br /> <br /> Self-inserts exist for a reason, and you should investigate your reason. Maybe you need to address a problem elsewhere, or maybe it is a healthy coping mechanism, or just a means to get in the story easier.<br /> <br /> Other than that, forget about idiots in the internet passing judgments on self-inserts. Most of the time they're just bigots looking for arguments to spill stupidity.<br /> <br /> Real literary analysis sees self-inserts as just a data point that contextualize a character, not a good or bad thing in itself. They're relevant to understand the author's process and message, period.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-14T11:09:58-07:00","id":1561688,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=monteparnas;n1561684]You should answer a few questions first:<br /> <br /> 1. Has it been a problem in your games?<br /> <br /> No it hasn't been a problem in our games and it hopefully it won't be.<br /> <br /> 3. What about yourself do you put in the characters so frequently?<br /> <br /> I come from a small family and I have a older sibling and we had a middle class background and those elements are usually consistent with some modifications.<br /> <br /> 4. Can you say why you do this? How you feel when doing it?<br /> <br /> I go by the notion of work with what you know and it felt right. Usually I don't mind it but there are times I feel like that I'm being derivative and not taking any chances.<br /> <br /> 5. Do you do it consciously or without notice?<br /> <br /> Most of the time it's without notice.<br /> <br /> 6. The self-insert has the same life as you?<br /> <br /> I try not and view it as possiblity of what kind of person I might have been if I choose this path.<br /> <br /> How does it differ?<br /> <br /> Much of the time it's different encomic backgrounds or family occupations. One of my favorite characters was man who joined the police force and most of his family couldn't believe it as they working in the business world.<br /> <br /> <br /> Other than that, forget about idiots in the internet passing judgments on self-inserts. Most of the time they're just bigots looking for arguments to spill stupidity.<br /> <br /> I agree with the above statement and proof positive about what they are saying about Christopher Nolan Odsesey and more recently Supergirl. There not even giving the movies a chance. But at least more and more people are calling them out on it and how there knowledge of film making, writing comics and manga is very lackluster <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-15T08:56:34-07:00","id":1561714,"title":"","content":"Then you don't have a problem, to begin with, you have a preference. And that's normal, a lot of great authors and actors have them. Lots of great characters are self-inserts.<br /> <br /> You're playing a game with friends, you don't have to hold yourself at standards that don't even make sense in the table. Unless the group is an unusual collection of pedantic assholes with a degree in literature, you're making one no favors taking risks for the same of it. Do it if you think it'll be fun, that's all.<br /> <br /> On the reason you do that, you should/could look for therapy if feasible. I'd say it's you trying to figure out how your life could have been, but this isn't in itself a problem, either. Unless you feel you have still issues to resolve or this kind of wandering thoughts are getting in the way of building your now and future, I wouldn't worry.<br /> <br /> And if it is, therapy. You won't solve problems by forcing yourself to play Bruce Wayne.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-15T11:20:36-07:00","id":1561720,"title":"","content":"I couldn't play Batman even though I'm a big fan of the character in general and see myself more of a Blurr type from Transformers then a brooding type that is popular in literature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-15T11:32:12-07:00","id":1561724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1526935-how-do-you-get-out-the-habit-of-not-turning-pc-s-into-self-inserts?p=1561720#post1561720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I couldn't play Batman even though I'm a big fan of the character in general and see myself more of a Blurr type from Transformers then a brooding type that is popular in literature.</div> </div> </div> </div>I once made a Changeling Sluagh that was all about being Batman, but that was literally her choosing it.<br /> <br /> She was brooding and quiet and stuff. Full of angst for the loss of her parents and decided to avenge them using her inherited fortune and combination of exquisite training and gadgets.<br /> <br /> Also she lived in her very alive middle class parents' house, in an extra floor she built with the good-but-not-that-extraordinary wealth she made.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}